---
import ExamLayout from '../layouts/ExamLayout.astro';
---

<ExamLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How ExamStatus collects and uses data, including analytics, push notifications, and third-party advertising."
>
  <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-6">Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-IN', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' })}</p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-4 mb-2">1. Information we collect</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 mb-2 leading-relaxed">
      We collect a limited set of technical information to keep the site useful and to understand which pages
      are helpful:
    </p>
    <ul class="text-sm text-gray-700 list-disc pl-5 mb-4 space-y-1">
      <li>Page path visited, device type, referrer, and country (derived from your network location, not GPS)</li>
      <li>If you opt in to push notifications: a browser-generated subscription endpoint used only to deliver alerts you asked for</li>
      <li>If you use the feedback form: the message you write and, optionally, a contact detail you choose to provide</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
      We do not require account creation, and we do not knowingly collect names, addresses, or government ID
      information through this site.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">2. Push notifications</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
      Push notifications are entirely opt-in. You can revoke permission at any time through your browser's
      site settings, which stops further alerts immediately.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">3. Advertising</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
      This site may display ads served through a third-party advertising partner to help cover hosting costs.
      These partners may use cookies or similar technology to serve relevant ads. We do not control third-party
      ad content directly and are not responsible for the content of external ad destinations.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">4. Data retention</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
      Analytics and feedback data is stored to help improve the site and is not sold or shared with third
      parties for marketing purposes.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">5. Contact</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
      Questions about this policy can be sent through the "Feedback" button on any page.
    </p>
  </div>
</ExamLayout>
